		{"id":"9e284dd8dbb17687","type":"text","x":0,"y":-360,"width":2000,"height":170,"text":"# Geoffrey Hinton — academic and industrial lineage\n\nDegree supervision, postdoctoral mentorship and company affiliations have distinct labels. This is a selected sourced branch, not a claim to list every student.\n\n[[00 Start Here|Guide]] · [[01 Map Index|All maps]] · [[03 Evidence and Open Questions|Evidence rules]]"},
		{"id":"fed61e62858173da","type":"text","x":2100,"y":-360,"width":1450,"height":170,"text":"**● HUMAN** blue · **◆ INSTITUTION** purple · **■ COMPANY** amber · **▣ LAB / TEAM** green · **◇ CONTEXT** grey\n\n**V** green edges = primary-source checked. **B** amber edges = book report. Full evidence and dates are in the linked notes. Grouping is navigation, not a current org chart."},
		{"id":"900b18885f33f0b2","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":350,"height":270,"text":"**● HUMAN** · web extension\n\n### [[People/Christopher Longuet-Higgins|Christopher Longuet-Higgins]]\n\nTheoretical chemist and cognitive scientist; Hinton's doctoral advisor.\n\n[Profile / source](https://homepages.inf.ed.ac.uk/steedman/hclhindependent.pdf)","color":"#43A8D1"},
		{"id":"09b55832b1dcdc91","type":"text","x":410,"y":0,"width":350,"height":270,"text":"**● HUMAN** · web extension\n\n### [[People/Stephen Isard|Stephen Isard]]\n\nHinton describes Steve Isard as an effective doctoral co-advisor; formal status requires checking.\n\n[Profile / source](https://groups.inf.ed.ac.uk/aics_history/AICSCSHistory_Interview005_GeoffreyHinton_publish.pdf)","color":"#43A8D1"},
		{"id":"028f43ffb8c8f2c7","type":"text","x":0,"y":330,"width":350,"height":270,"text":"**◆ INSTITUTION** · book + web\n\n### [[Institutions/University of Cambridge|University of Cambridge]]\n\nUniversity.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.cam.ac.uk/)","color":"#B19CDE"},
		{"id":"ca9fc3c75bd6b6fe","type":"text","x":410,"y":330,"width":350,"height":270,"text":"**◆ INSTITUTION** · book + web\n\n### [[Institutions/University of Edinburgh|University of Edinburgh]]\n\nUniversity; Hinton doctoral institution.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.ed.ac.uk/)","color":"#B19CDE"},
		{"id":"2cf9befd4ab65d92","type":"text","x":0,"y":660,"width":350,"height":270,"text":"**◆ INSTITUTION** · book + web\n\n### [[Institutions/Carnegie Mellon University|Carnegie Mellon University]]\n\nUniversity; historical Hinton faculty post and Salakhutdinov faculty affiliation.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.cmu.edu/)","color":"#B19CDE"},
		{"id":"25df4ff0a0b374ad","type":"text","x":410,"y":660,"width":350,"height":270,"text":"**◆ INSTITUTION** · book + web\n\n### [[Institutions/University of Toronto|University of Toronto]]\n\nUniversity; Hinton and AlexNet academic base.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.utoronto.ca/)","color":"#B19CDE"},
		{"id":"1f12f22475612845","type":"text","x":1250,"y":400,"width":420,"height":230,"text":"**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Geoffrey Hinton|Geoffrey Hinton]]\n\nNeural-network researcher; Toronto emeritus professor; historical Google researcher.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.cs.toronto.edu/~hinton/)","color":"#43A8D1"},
		{"id":"4ff56935ca781619","type":"text","x":2050,"y":0,"width":350,"height":270,"text":"**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Ilya Sutskever|Ilya Sutskever]]\n\nHinton PhD alumnus, DNNresearch and OpenAI cofounder; historical university profile.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.cs.toronto.edu/~ilya/)","color":"#43A8D1"},
		{"id":"69f8b076b3ac387b","type":"text","x":2460,"y":0,"width":350,"height":270,"text":"**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Volodymyr Mnih|Volodymyr Mnih]]\n\nHinton PhD alumnus; DQN researcher. Distinct from brother Andriy Mnih.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.cs.utoronto.ca/~vmnih/)","color":"#43A8D1"},
		{"id":"83bf3c7282aa094b","type":"text","x":2050,"y":330,"width":350,"height":270,"text":"**● HUMAN** · web extension\n\n### [[People/Ruslan Salakhutdinov|Ruslan Salakhutdinov]]\n\nHinton PhD alumnus; CMU machine-learning professor.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~rsalakhu/)","color":"#43A8D1"},
		{"id":"0e5610b04f205fec","type":"text","x":2460,"y":330,"width":350,"height":270,"text":"**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Yee Whye Teh|Yee Whye Teh]]\n\nHinton doctoral alumnus; Maddison doctoral co-supervisor.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.stats.ox.ac.uk/~teh/)","color":"#43A8D1"},
		{"id":"254fd86742b73c2e","type":"text","x":2050,"y":660,"width":350,"height":270,"text":"**● HUMAN** · web extension\n\n### [[People/Radford Neal|Radford Neal]]\n\nIncluded because a sourced relationship names this entity.\n\nSee linked evidence note","color":"#43A8D1"},
